    {
        "content": "<p>adamrk opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14213\">PR #14213</a> from <code>adamrk:defer-bulk-op-fuel-consumption</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For bulk operations and memory/table grows, defer consuming fuel until the operation has succeed.</p>\n<p>This fixes <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14161\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14161</a>.</p>\n<p>For small statically known sizes, we immediately consume fuel, but for larger or dynamic sizes we insert a fuel/epoch check before the operation and then only consume the variable fuel amount after.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 619308818,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1787756503
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>adamrk updated <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14213\">PR #14213</a>.</p>",
