    {
        "content": "<p>github-merge-queue[bot] removed <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14213\">PR #14213 <code>fuel</code>: Defer fuel consumption for bulk operations</a> from the merge queue.</p>",
